  "correct": "1",
  "solution": "The logic followed here is:\n\nBODMAS rule:\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/13bc0065c96e715682af7c8a6dc1b4c567b7a2a89597cc68809a5ff942c7e421.png] \n\nLets check each option.\n\nOption 1) ÷, ×, –, +, = \n\nInterchanging the * with mathematical signs,\n\nWe get: __**16 ÷ 4**__ × 8 - 10 + 2 = 24\n\n⇒ **__4 × 8__** - 10 + 2 = 24\n\n⇒ __**32**__ - 10 **__+ 2__** = 24\n\n⇒ __**34 - 10**__ = 24\n\n⇒ 24 = 24\n\n⇒ **LHS = RHS**\n\nOption 2) –, ÷, +, ×, =\n\nInterchanging the * with mathematical signs,\n\nWe get: 16 - __**4 ÷ 8**__ + 10 × 2 = 24\n\n⇒ 16 - 0.5 + __**10 × 2**__ = 24\n\n⇒ __**16**__ - 0.5 __**+ 20 **__= 24\n\n⇒ __**36 - 0.5**__ = 24\n\n⇒ 35.5 ≠ 24\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 3) ×, ÷, –, +, = \n\nInterchanging the * with mathematical signs,\n\nWe get: 16 × __**4 ÷ 8**__ - 10 + 2 = 24\n\n⇒ __**16 × 0.5 **__- 10 + 2 = 24\n\n⇒ __**8**__ - 10 __**+ 2 **__= 24\n\n⇒ __**10 - 10**__ = 24\n\n⇒ 0 ≠ 24\n\n⇒ **LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nOption 4) ÷, +, ×, –, =\n\nInterchanging the * with mathematical signs,\n\nWe get: __**16 ÷ 4**__ + 8 × 10 - 2 = 24\n\n⇒ 4 + __**8 × 10**__ - 2 = 24\n\n⇒ __**4 + 80**__ - 2 = 24\n\n⇒ __**84 - 2**__ = 24\n\n⇒ 82 ≠ 24\n\n⇒**LHS ≠ RHS**\n\nHence, the correct answer is **\"÷, ×, –, +, =****\"**.",
